.TH SDL_HINT_VIDEO_METAL_AUTO_RESIZE_DRAWABLE 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_VIDEO_METAL_AUTO_RESIZE_DRAWABLE \- A variable indicating whether the metal layer drawable size should be updated for the
.BR SDL_EVENT_WINDOW_PIXEL_SIZE_CHANGED
event on macOS.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_VIDEO_METAL_AUTO_RESIZE_DRAWABLE \(dqSDL_VIDEO_METAL_AUTO_RESIZE_DRAWABLE\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The variable can be set to the following values:
.PP

\(bu \(dq0\(dq: the metal layer drawable size will not be updated on the
.BR SDL_EVENT_WINDOW_PIXEL_SIZE_CHANGED
event\[char46]
.PP
\(bu \(dq1\(dq: the metal layer drawable size will be updated on the
.BR SDL_EVENT_WINDOW_PIXEL_SIZE_CHANGED
event\[char46] (default)
.PP
This hint should be set before
.BR SDL_Metal_CreateView
called\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

